Package: xclawer
Version: 1.0.0
Section: web
Priority: optional
Architecture: amd64
Depends: python3 (>= 3.8),
 libasound2, libatk-bridge2.0-0, libatk1.0-0, libatspi2.0-0,
 libcairo2, libcups2, libdbus-1-3, libdrm2, libegl1, libfontconfig1,
 libfreetype6, libgbm1, libglib2.0-0, libgtk-3-0, libnspr4, libnss3,
 libpango-1.0-0, libx11-6, libx11-xcb1, libxcb1, libxcomposite1,
 libxdamage1, libxext6, libxfixes3, libxrandr2, libxshmfence1,
 fonts-liberation
Maintainer: mikiya
Description: X.com tweet scraper with news radar and web console
 Collects tweets from X.com via Playwright, filters and scores them with
 AI (DeepSeek), runs an RSS + X news radar with WeChat push, and serves
 a web console on port 5001.
 .
 The virtualenv is bundled in the package. Data (database, browser
 session, logs, scheduler state) lives in /var/lib/xclawer;
 configuration lives in /etc/xclawer/.env.
